{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2021-10-12 10:26:00', 'title': 'NEW SURVEY REVEALS 70% OF AMERICANS ARE PUTTING "ME-TIME" ON HOLD WHEN THEY NEED IT MOST', 'text': "SOUTH DEERFIELD, MASS., OCT. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AS THE HOLIDAY SEASON FAST APPROACHES, A RECENT SURVEY CONDUCTED BY ONEPOLL, AND SPONSORED BY NEWELL BRANDS, THE MAKERS OF WOODWICK® CANDLES, REVEALED THAT AMERICANS AREN'T FINDING ENOUGH TIME TO DEDICATE TO THEMSELVES, LEAVING MANY (65 PERCENT) FEELING LESS ENGAGED WITH FRIENDS AND FAMILY THROUGHOUT THE SEASON."}